%SIXMD 1
# @?MKDIR - CREATE DIRECTORIES

## DESCRIPTION

CREATES EACH NAMED DIRECTORY WITH MODE 0777.

USAGE IS 'MKDIR DIR ...'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/MKDIR
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/MKDIR.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

